### get unique account
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/92782d6a-6d7f-44b1-abd4-1b7850800d6e

### list all accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts

### delete account with google
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/accounts/da249e76-3f93-4b55-bb23-9b07df894e78

### import from google
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/import/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orgPath": "/Integrador-teste/Maplebear - Krypton"
}

